#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of NetworkManager"
msgstr "Instalação do NetworkManager"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:165
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <xref linkend=\"qt5\"/> is installed and the Qt based examples are "
"desired, fix two meson.build files:"
msgstr ""
"Se &quot;<xref linkend=\"qt5\"/>&quot; estiver instalado e os exemplos "
"baseados em &quot;Qt&quot; forem desejados, [então] corrija dois arquivos "
"&quot;meson.build&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:169
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e 's/-qt4/-qt5/'              \\\n"
"    -e 's/moc_location/host_bins/' \\\n"
"    -i examples/C/qt/meson.build   &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"sed -e 's/Qt/&amp;5/'                  \\\n"
"    -i meson.build</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e 's/-qt4/-qt5/'             \\\n"
"    -e 's/moc_location/host_bins/' \\\n"
"    -i examples/C/qt/meson.build   &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"sed -e 's/Qt/&amp;5/'                  \\\n"
"    -i meson.build</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:185
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Fix the python scripts so that they use <application>Python 3</application>:"
msgstr ""
"Corrija os conjuntos sequenciais de comandos &quot;Python&quot;, de forma "
"que eles usem &quot;<application>Python 3</application>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:189
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>grep -rl '^#!.*python$' | xargs sed -i "
"'1s/python/&amp;3/'</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>grep -rl '^#!.*python$' | xargs sed -i "
"'1s/python/&amp;3/'</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:192
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>NetworkManager</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>NetworkManager</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:196
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"CXXFLAGS+=\"-O2 -fPIC\"            \\\n"
"meson setup ..                   \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr              \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release        \\\n"
"      -Dlibaudit=no              \\\n"
"      -Dnmtui=true               \\\n"
"      -Dovs=false                \\\n"
"      -Dppp=false                \\\n"
"      -Dselinux=false            \\\n"
"      -Dsession_tracking=elogind \\\n"
"      -Dmodem_manager=false      \\\n"
"      -Dsystemdsystemunitdir=no  \\\n"
"      -Dsystemd_journal=false    \\\n"
"      -Dqt=false                 &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"CXXFLAGS+=\"-O2 -fPIC\"            \\\n"
"meson setup ..                   \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr              \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release        \\\n"
"      -Dlibaudit=no              \\\n"
"      -Dnmtui=true               \\\n"
"      -Dovs=false                \\\n"
"      -Dppp=false                \\\n"
"      -Dselinux=false            \\\n"
"      -Dsession_tracking=elogind \\\n"
"      -Dmodem_manager=false      \\\n"
"      -Dsystemdsystemunitdir=no  \\\n"
"      -Dsystemd_journal=false    \\\n"
"      -Dqt=false                 &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:215
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build    &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"CXXFLAGS+=\"-O2 -fPIC\"            \\\n"
"meson setup ..                   \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr              \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release        \\\n"
"      -Dlibaudit=no              \\\n"
"      -Dnmtui=true               \\\n"
"      -Dovs=false                \\\n"
"      -Dppp=false                \\\n"
"      -Dselinux=false            \\\n"
"      -Dqt=false                 \\\n"
"      -Dsession_tracking=systemd \\\n"
"      -Dmodem_manager=false      &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build    &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"CXXFLAGS+=\"-O2 -fPIC\"            \\\n"
"meson setup ..                   \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr              \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release        \\\n"
"      -Dlibaudit=no              \\\n"
"      -Dnmtui=true               \\\n"
"      -Dovs=false                \\\n"
"      -Dppp=false                \\\n"
"      -Dselinux=false            \\\n"
"      -Dqt=false                 \\\n"
"      -Dsession_tracking=systemd \\\n"
"      -Dmodem_manager=false      &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:233
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"An already active graphical session with a bus address is necessary to run "
"the tests. To test the results, issue <command>ninja test</command>."
msgstr ""
"Uma sessão gráfica já ativa com endereço de barramento é necessária para "
"executar os testes. Para testar os resultados, emita &quot;<command>ninja "
"test</command>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:239
#, xml-text
msgid "A few tests may fail, depending on enabled kernel options."
msgstr ""
"Uns poucos testes possivelmente falhem, dependendo das opções de núcleo "
"habilitadas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:243
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:246
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>ninja install &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv -v /usr/share/doc/NetworkManager{,-&NetworkManager-version;}</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>ninja install &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv -v /usr/share/doc/NetworkManager{,-&NetworkManager-version;}</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:250
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have not passed the <option>-Ddocs=true</option> option to "
"<command>meson</command>, you can install the pregenerated manual pages with"
" (as the &root; user):"
msgstr ""
"Se você não passou a opção &quot;<option>-Ddocs=true</option>&quot; para "
"&quot;<command>meson</command>&quot;, [então] você consegue instalar as "
"páginas de manual pré geradas com (como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;&root;&quot;):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:255
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>for file in $(echo ../man/*.[1578]); do\n"
"    section=${file##*.} &amp;&amp;\n"
"    install -vdm 755 /usr/share/man/man$section\n"
"    install -vm 644 $file /usr/share/man/man$section/\n"
"done</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>for file in $(echo ../man/*.[1578]); do\n"
"   section=${file##*.} &amp;&amp;\n"
"   install -vdm 755 /usr/share/man/man$section\n"
"   install -vm 644 $file /usr/share/man/man$section/\n"
"done</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:262
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have not used <option>-Ddocs=true</option>, the pregenerated HTML "
"documentation can also be installed with (as the &root; user):"
msgstr ""
"Se você não tiver usado <option>-Ddocs=true</option>, a documentação HTML "
"pré gerada também pode ser instalada com (como o(a) usuário(a) &root;):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:268
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cp -Rv ../docs/{api,libnm} "
"/usr/share/doc/NetworkManager-&NetworkManager-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cp -Rv ../docs/{api,libnm} "
"/usr/share/doc/NetworkManager-&NetworkManager-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:273
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:276
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<envar>CXXFLAGS=\"-O2 -fPIC\"</envar>: These compiler options are necessary "
"to build the Qt5 based examples."
msgstr ""
"<envar>CXXFLAGS=\"-O2 -fPIC\"</envar>: Essas opções do compilador são "
"necessárias para construir exemplos baseados em &quot;Qt5&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:284
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Ddocs=true</option>: Use this switch to enable building man pages "
"and documentation if <xref linkend=\"gtk-doc\"/> is installed."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Ddocs=true</option>: Use essa chave para habilitar a construção de "
"páginas de manual e documentação se &quot;<xref linkend=\"gtk-doc\"/>&quot; "
"estiver instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:289
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dnmtui=true</parameter>: This switch enables building "
"<command>nmtui</command>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dnmtui=true</parameter>: Essa chave habilita construir "
"<command>nmtui</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:294
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dsystemdsystemunitdir=no</parameter> and "
"<parameter>-Dsystemd_journal=false</parameter>: systemd is not used for sysv"
" init systems, so prevent installing units and using the systemd journal."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dsystemdsystemunitdir=no</parameter> e "
"<parameter>-Dsystemd_journal=false</parameter>: systemd não é usado para "
"sistemas de inicialização SysV, de forma que evite instalar unidades e usar "
"o diário do systemd."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:301
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dovs=false</parameter>: This switch disable the Open vSwitch "
"integration because it needs <xref linkend='jansson'/>.  Remove it if you "
"have <xref linkend='jansson'/> installed on your system."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dovs=false</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita a integração do "
"Open vSwitch porque ela precisa de <xref linkend='jansson'/>. Remova-a se "
"você tiver <xref linkend='jansson'/> instalado em teu sistema."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:308
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dmodem_manager=false</parameter>: This switch is required if "
"<application>ModemManager</application> is not installed. Omit this switch "
"if you have built <application>ModemManager</application> and "
"<application>mobile-broadband-provider-info</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dmodem_manager=false</parameter>: Essa chave é exigida se o "
"<application>ModemManager</application> não estiver instalado. Omita essa "
"chave se você tiver construído <application>ModemManager</application> e "
"<application>mobile-broadband-provider-info</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:315
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dsession_tracking=elogind</parameter>: This switch is used to "
"set <command>elogind</command> as the default program for session tracking."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dsession_tracking=elogind</parameter>: Essa chave é usada para "
"configurar o &quot;<command>elogind</command>&quot; como o aplicativo padrão"
" para rastreamento de sessão."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:321
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dsession_tracking=systemd</parameter>: This switch is used to "
"set <command>systemd-logind</command> as the default program for session "
"tracking."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dsession_tracking=systemd</parameter>: Essa chave é usada para "
"configurar o &quot;<command>systemd-logind</command>&quot; como o aplicativo"
" padrão para rastreamento de sessão."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:333
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dppp=false</parameter>: This switch disables "
"<application>PPP</application> support in "
"<application>NetworkManager</application> since the programs necessary for "
"it are not installed. Remove this switch if you need PPP support and have "
"<application>PPP</application> installed."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dppp=false</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita o suporte a "
"<application>PPP</application> no <application>NetworkManager</application>,"
" já que os aplicativos necessários para isso não estão instalados. Remova "
"essa chave se você precisar de suporte a PPP e tiver o "
"<application>PPP</application> instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:341
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dlibaudit=no</parameter> and "
"<parameter>-Dselinux=false</parameter>: This switch disables support for "
"libaudit and SELinux since they are not used in BLFS."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dlibaudit=no</parameter> e "
"<parameter>-Dselinux=false</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita o suporte para"
" libaudit e SELinux, vez que ele(a) não é usado(a) no BLFS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:347
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dqt=false</parameter>: This switch disables the "
"<application>Qt</application> examples. Omit if you have "
"<application>Qt</application> available and wish to install the examples."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dqt=false</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita os exemplos "
"<application>QT</application>. Omita se você tiver o "
"<application>Qt</application> disponível e desejar instalar os exemplos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:353
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dcrypto=gnutls</option>: Use this switch if you have GnuTLS "
"installed and want to use it for certificate and key operations in "
"NetworkManager, instead of using NSS (the default)."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dcrypto=gnutls</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver o GnuTLS "
"instalado e quiser usá-lo para operações de certificados e chaves no "
"NetworkManager, em vez de usar o NSS (o padrão)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:359
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dcrypto=null</option>: Use this switch if neither NSS nor GnuTLS is"
" installed but you want to build NetworkManager anyway.  This switch will "
"make NetworkManager lack some features (for example 802.1X)."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dcrypto=null</option>: Use essa chave se nem o NSS nem o GnuTLS "
"estiverem instalados, mas você quiser construir o NetworkManager de qualquer"
" maneira. Essa chave fará com que o NetworkManager careça de alguns recursos"
" (por exemplo, 802.1X)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:366
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dsuspend_resume=upower</option>: Use this switch if you have <xref "
"linkend='upower'/> installed and want to use it (instead of &logind;) for "
"suspend and resume support."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dsuspend_resume=upower</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver <xref"
" linkend='upower'/> instalado e quiser usá-lo (em vez de &logind;) para "
"suspender e retomar o suporte."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/networkmanager.xml:373
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring NetworkManager"
msgstr "Configurando o NetworkManager"

